  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-11-24",
    modifiedTime: "2026-11-24",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "bowflex treadmill black friday",
      "bowflex black friday deals",
      "bowflex t6 black friday",
      "bowflex t9 black friday",
      "bowflex t16 black friday",
      "bowflex treadmill sale",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "Touchscreen: Bowflex T16", link: PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/price/">By Price</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Black Friday 2026</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Bowflex Treadmill Black Friday Deals 2026</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Bowflex is running a Black Friday sale on its own store now, with no code needed: on 24 November 2026 the T6 was $899, the T9 $1,399 and the T16 $1,999. The T6 and T9 offers end on Friday 27 November and the T16’s a day earlier, on 26 November. Here is every model’s Black Friday price, what it sold for before, what Amazon charges, and which of the deals is worth acting on.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 24, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS<br />
          <span class="ed-method">How we chose: makers’ published specifications and manuals, independent reviews and owner reports, cross-checked. Not tested hands-on.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We may earn a commission when you buy through the links below. It costs you nothing and never decides a ranking. <a href="/editorial-standards/">How we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#bowflex-t16"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31I8-29nvEL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Bowflex T16" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#bowflex-bxt8j"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FlB8FDyvL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Bowflex BXT8J" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#bowflex-treadmill-10"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ic39uYzSL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Bowflex Treadmill 10" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Bowflex T16 · Bowflex BXT8J · Bowflex Treadmill 10</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Bowflex, owned since 2024 by Johnson Health Tech (the group behind Horizon and Matrix), sells
          three current treadmills on its US store: the T6, the T9 and the T16. Each one has a regular price
          and a sale price, and the sale price is what Bowflex charges most of the time. This week Bowflex has
          put all three under a “Black Friday Sale” banner that promises “Save up to $1,200 + Free Shipping”,
          but the $1,200 is on a bike, and the treadmill savings are $300 to $400 off the regular price. The
          useful question is not how big the discount looks but whether the price is lower than the machine
          has actually sold for. We read Bowflex’s US store and Amazon’s listings on 24 November 2026. Every
          figure below carries the date we saw it, and earlier prices come from our own Bowflex reviews and
          guides, with their dates.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
          <h2>Our top picks:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Touchscreen:</span> <a href="#bowflex-t16">Bowflex T16</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Amazon Only:</span> <a href="#bowflex-bxt8j">Bowflex BXT8J</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[1].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Avoid at This Price:</span> <a href="#bowflex-treadmill-10">Bowflex Treadmill 10</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[2].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Avoid at This Price:</span> <a href="#bowflex-treadmill-7">Bowflex Treadmill 7</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[3].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <nav class="ed-toc not-prose" aria-label="In this roundup">
          <h2>In this roundup</h2>
          <ol>
            <li><a href="#short-answer">The Short Answer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#price-table">Black Friday price by model</a></li>
            <li><a href="#picks">The Bowflex Treadmills on Amazon This Black Friday</a></li>
            <li><a href="#real-deal">Is Bowflex’s Black Friday Price a Real Deal?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#terms">How Bowflex’s Black Friday Offer Works</a></li>
            <li><a href="#which-model">Which Bowflex to Buy at Black Friday Prices</a></li>
            <li><a href="#step-up">What Each Step Up Costs This Week</a></li>
            <li><a href="#delivered-cost">The Delivered Price: What You Actually Pay</a></li>
            <li><a href="#bowflex-or-amazon">Bowflex’s Store or Amazon: Where to Buy</a></li>
            <li><a href="#vs-other-brands">Bowflex vs Horizon and Sole at Black Friday Prices</a></li>
            <li><a href="#when-to-buy">When to Buy: Before the Deadline, or Wait?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#checklist">Before You Click Buy: A Bowflex Checklist</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <div id="short-answer" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>The Short Answer</h2>
<p>
            <strong>Bowflex’s Black Friday 2026 prices are $899 for the T6, $1,399 for the T9 and $1,999 for
            the T16 on bowflex.com, read on 24 November 2026, with no code needed.</strong> Bowflex labels them
            part of its Black Friday Sale: $400 off the T6 and T9 until 27 November, and $300 off plus free
            shipping on the T16 until 26 November.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Best value:</strong> the T6 at $899, a 20 by <a href="/best-treadmills-with-60-inch-deck/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium" data-autolink>60-inch deck</a>, 12 mph, 15% incline and a
            325 lb rating. A good price, but the same $899 bowflex.com showed on 14 October.</li>
            <li><strong>Best for runners:</strong> the T9 at $1,399, with a 22-inch-wide deck and a 350 lb
            rating. It matches the $1,399 we saw in mid-October and is $100 below the $1,499 of 20 October.</li>
            <li><strong>Not a new low:</strong> the T16 at $1,999 is $100 above the $1,899 sale price of
            14 October, though the free shipping (standard delivery is normally $99) brings the delivered
            total to about the same.</li>
            <li><strong>Amazon is dearer this week:</strong> the T16 was $2,150.00 on Amazon, and the T6 and T9
            are not sold there. The discontinued Treadmill 10 and Treadmill 7 listings on Amazon are priced well
            above what those models sold for new.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            For every model’s price outside sale weeks, see <a href="/how-much-does-a-bowflex-treadmill-cost/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">how much a Bowflex treadmill costs</a>; for deals
            across every brand, our <a href="/treadmill-black-friday-deals/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">Black Friday treadmill deals</a> guide.
          </p>
        </div>

