          <p>
            The T6 to T9 step is unchanged at $500, and it is the step most worth paying for if you run. The
            T9 to T16 step widens by $100 on the sticker, but because the T16 offer includes free shipping
            and the others do not, the delivered gap is about the same as usual if you take standard
            delivery ($99 on the T6 and T9 product pages on 24 November). In short: the sale does not change
            which Bowflex is right for you, so pick the model first and the price second.
