        <section id="faq" class="ed-faq scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
          <details open>
            <summary><h3>Does Bowflex have Black Friday treadmill deals in 2026?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Yes. On 24 November 2026 bowflex.com had the T6 at $899 and the T9 at $1,399, each $400 off, until 27 November, and the T16 at $1,999, $300 off with free shipping, until 26 November. No code is needed; the offers end at 11:59 pm Central.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>What is a good Black Friday price for a Bowflex T6?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              $899 or less. That is its Black Friday price on bowflex.com on 24 November 2026, and the lowest we have recorded, but bowflex.com also charged $899 on 14 October, so it is a good price rather than a new low. Add $99 for standard delivery.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Is the Bowflex T16 cheaper on Black Friday?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Not really. $1,999 on 24 November 2026 is $100 above the $1,899 sale price we recorded on 14 October. The Black Friday offer includes free shipping, which normally costs $99 for standard delivery, so the delivered total is about the same as in October.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Can you buy Bowflex treadmills on Amazon?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Only some. On 24 November 2026 Amazon had the T16 at $2,150.00, $151 more than bowflex.com, plus the older BXT8J and the discontinued Treadmill 10 and Treadmill 7 at prices above their history. We could not find the T6 or T9 on Amazon US.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Does Bowflex price match Black Friday deals?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Its Price Match Promise covers lower prices and shipping offers on the same product from authorised retailers, if you contact Bowflex before you buy. Third-party marketplace sellers, coupon-code prices, clearance and open-box offers are excluded.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Will Bowflex treadmills be cheaper on Cyber Monday?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              We do not know, and Bowflex had not said on 24 November. Its Black Friday offers end on 26 and 27 November; Cyber Monday is 30 November 2026. If prices change, compare them with the Black Friday prices on this page rather than with Bowflex’s regular prices.
            </p>
          </details>
        </section>

